WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:07.860 --> 00:00:09.160
And now the nominees for the

00:00:09.160 --> 00:00:12.820
best political speech by an entertainment celebrity

00:00:12.820 --> 00:00:14.260
Meryl Streep

00:00:14.260 --> 00:00:15.540
Jesse Williams

00:00:15.540 --> 00:00:17.080
Ashley Judd

00:00:17.080 --> 00:00:19.200
That Sheriff from Stranger Things

00:00:19.200 --> 00:00:22.180
The Less Attractive Zach Galifianakis

00:00:22.180 --> 00:00:24.400
and the winner is

00:00:24.400 --> 00:00:28.220
Less Attractive Zach Galifianakis

00:00:28.220 --> 00:00:30.080
thank you thank you very much

00:00:30.080 --> 00:00:32.180
you know takes a lot of courage to

00:00:32.180 --> 00:00:34.260
stand up and say things

00:00:34.260 --> 00:00:36.780
that everyone in the room already wants to hear

00:00:36.780 --> 00:00:39.820
and I think we entertainment celebrities are

00:00:39.829 --> 00:00:41.960
going to be vilified for our bravery

00:00:41.960 --> 00:00:45.079
here tonight but it's our job to unify a

00:00:45.079 --> 00:00:48.350
country that has been torn apart by hate

00:00:48.350 --> 00:00:52.129
and ignorance and racism misogyny and

00:00:52.129 --> 00:00:54.379
pickup trucks and domestic beer and

00:00:54.380 --> 00:00:55.840
Waffle House and

00:00:55.840 --> 00:00:57.800
stupid accents

00:00:57.800 --> 00:01:01.220
how did our country become so divided?

00:01:01.220 --> 00:01:05.620
its time now for us to join together as Americans

00:01:05.620 --> 00:01:07.420
and destroy the other half of

00:01:07.420 --> 00:01:09.500
America that refuses to believe

00:01:09.500 --> 00:01:13.080
in what we believe in

00:01:13.080 --> 00:01:16.020
we might fight for peace

00:01:16.020 --> 00:01:17.860
and we must continue fighting

00:01:17.860 --> 00:01:21.220
until mixed martial arts become fine arts

00:01:21.220 --> 00:01:24.220
till Cracker-Barrels become Crate and Barrels

00:01:24.220 --> 00:01:26.820
Till Fast and Furious 8 becomes

00:01:26.820 --> 00:01:28.020
Hamilton 2

00:01:28.020 --> 00:01:29.380
thank you very much for my award

00:01:29.380 --> 00:01:31.340
thank you to the academy

00:01:31.340 --> 00:01:33.620
#freepolanski

